  "decontamination_notes": "Real fix from networkx/networkx PR #8813, merged 2026-08-04, after model training cutoffs, so the specific fix is novel. Repo sliced at the PR's base commit f884a12 (networkx package + BSD LICENSE + pyproject.toml). networkx core imports without numpy/scipy, and vf2pp is pure Python, so tests run on the base sandbox image with PYTHONPATH=.. The bug: vf2pp_isomorphism / vf2pp_all_isomorphisms returned the node mapping reversed (G2->G1) rather than the documented G1->G2. Hidden tests assert the public mapping's direction and its validity as a G1->G2 isomorphism, never internal state.",
